.TH AURORA-MODEL-FETCH 1 "November 2026" "Aurora demos"
.SH NAME
aurora-model-fetch \- fetch and verify an open demo model
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aurora-model-fetch
.RI [ --cache " DIR" ]
.RB [ --refresh ]
.I MODEL
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fetch rnnoise, df3 or whisper-tiny.en on explicit request. Print the verified
local path. Downloads use immutable URLs and SHA-256 identities from the
installed model manifest. RNNoise serialization has a separate output hash.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --cache " DIR"
Use DIR instead of the XDG cache location.
.TP
.B --refresh
Download and verify before atomically replacing an existing cached model.
.TP
.B --help
Print usage.
.SH FILES
The default cache is $XDG_CACHE_HOME/aurora-models, or ~/.cache/aurora-models.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero means a verified model path was printed. A nonzero status leaves the
previous cache intact. Corrupt cached data requires an explicit refresh.
.SH NOTES
Installation downloads no weights and starts no service. See the installed
manifest for each model's source and licence. No microphone or speaker is used.
